# TEST-only tools for the sidecar's unit and HTTP-contract tests, installed
# into a throwaway environment -- never into the shipped image.
#
# fastapi and python-multipart are the HTTP layer's own runtime deps
# (starlette comes with fastapi). They are listed UNPINNED: their versions
# come from requirements.txt through the constraint below, so the runtime
# lock is their one pin home and this lock cannot drift from it. A
# constraint only pins what is requested, so torch/demucs/whisperx never
# enter this lock and the test venv stays ML-free. Regenerate with uv (the
# recipe in requirements-test.txt): pip/pip-tools refuse this constraint
# file ("Constraints cannot have extras", from uvicorn[standard]).
#
# httpx is not a direct import of test_app.py -- it is what
# starlette.testclient.TestClient requires, and the concurrency tests use
# httpx.ASGITransport directly.
-c requirements.txt
pytest
httpx
fastapi
python-multipart
